ār","gloss":"difficult"},{"text":"அமர்","lemma":"amar","gloss":"battle"}],"gloss":"difficult battle"},{"surface":"உழப்பதும்","parts":[{"text":"உழப்பது","lemma":"uḻappu","gloss":"enduring"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and enduring"},{"surface":"அமரியளாகி","parts":[{"text":"அமரியள்","lemma":"amariyaḷ","gloss":"she who is desired"},{"text":"ஆகி","lemma":"āki","gloss":"having become"}],"gloss":"having become the desired one"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முறஞ்செவி","parts":[{"text":"முறம்","lemma":"muṟam","gloss":"winnowing fan"},{"text":"செவி","lemma":"cevi","gloss":"ear"}],"gloss":"winnowing-fan-like ears"},{"surface":"யானை","parts":[{"text":"யானை","lemma":"yāṉai","gloss":"elephant"}],"gloss":"elephant"},{"surface":"வேந்தர்","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தர்","lemma":"vēntar","gloss":"kings"}],"gloss":"kings"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறங்கெழு","parts":[{"text":"மறம்","lemma":"maṟam","gloss":"valor"},{"text":"கெழு","lemma":"keḻu","gloss":"filled with"}],"gloss":"filled with valor"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சங்","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சங்","lemma":"நெஞ்சங்","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொண்டொளித்தோளே","parts":[{"text":"கொண்டு","lemma":"koṇṭu","gloss":"having taken"},{"text":"ஒளித்தோள்","lemma":"oḷittōḷ","gloss":"she who hid"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"she stole and hid"}]}],"literal":"The tall bull of many cows that traversed the wide fields / rests in the excellent shade of the palmyra tree, while cowherds / pluck jasmine flowers dense with blossoms; / the long-eared small hare, thrown at with a short stick, / leaps along with the vāḷai fish in the expanse of deep waters; / women with garlanded waists and bangled arms / bathe in the sea, leap into the pond, / and pluck the blue water-lily flowers of the backwaters, / wearing swaying fresh leaf-garments, in the victorious battle... / ... latti / may she grow always! She indeed, / having become the desired one for whom they endure difficult battles, / has stolen and hidden the valorous hearts of the kings / who possess elephants with winnowing-fan-like ears.","translation":"The tall bull of many cows that roam the wide fields rests in the excellent shade of the palmyra tree, while cowherds pluck jasmine flowers dense with blossoms. A long-eared small hare, startled by a short stick thrown at it, leaps into the deep waters alongside the vāḷai fish. Women with garlanded waists and bangled arms bathe in the sea, leap into the ponds, pluck blue water-lilies from the backwaters, and wear swaying garments of fresh leaves. In this rich land, may she grow forever! She, who has become the cause of fierce battles, has stolen and hidden away the valorous hearts of the kings who ride elephants with winnowing-fan-like ears.","modern":"பரந்த நிலத்தில் திரியும் பல பசுக்களைக் கொண்ட பெரிய காளை மாடு பனை மரத்தின் சிறந்த நிழலில் இளைப்பாற, இடையர்கள் அடர்ந்த முல்லைப் பூக்களைப் பறிக்கிறார்கள். எறியப்பட்ட சிறிய கோலால் அஞ்சிய நீண்ட காதுகளைக் கொண்ட முயல், ஆழமான நீர்நிலையில் வாளை மீனுடன் சேர்ந்து துள்ளி விளையாடுகிறது. மாலை அணிந்த இடையும் வளையல் அணிந்த தோள்களும் கொண்ட பெண்கள் கடலில் நீராடி, குளத்தில் பாய்ந்து, உப்பங்கழியில் நெய்தல் பூக்களைப் பறித்து, அசையும் பசிய தழையாடையை உடுத்துகிறார்கள். இத்தகைய வளமிக்க நாட்டில் வாழும் அவள் என்றும் வளர வேண்டும். அரிய போரைச் சந்திக்கக் காரணமானவளாகி, முறம் போன்ற காதுகளைக் கொண்ட யானைகளை உடைய அரசர்களின் வீரமிக்க நெஞ்சங்களைக் கவர்ந்து மறைத்துக் கொண்டவள் அவளே.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Kañci tinai and the theme of Makatpar Kañci, which describes a situation where a father refuses to give his daughter in marriage, leading to an impending war. The poet begins by describing the immense wealth and beauty of the girl's land, blending pastoral, agricultural, and coastal landscapes. We see peaceful scenes of bulls resting under palmyra trees, cowherds plucking jasmine, hares leaping with fish, and women bathing in the sea. This rich setting emphasizes the high status of the girl and her family. The poem then shifts to the girl herself, wishing for her long life and prosperity. She is so beautiful that she has captivated the hearts of powerful kings, who are now ready to wage a fierce battle to win her hand.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.37],[1.59,2.34],[2.34,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.74],[3.74,4.09],[4.09,4.35],[4.35,4.7],[4.7,5.13],[5.13,5.39],[5.39,5.83],[5.83,6.18],[6.18,6.3],[6.3,8.9],[8.9,10.1],[10.1,10.5],[10.5,10.9],[10.9,11.9],[11.9,12.5],[12.5,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.6],[13.6,15.15],[15.15,15.37],[15.37,15.81],[15.81,16.7],[16.7,17.0],[17.0,17.3],[17.3,17.6],[17.6,17.9],[18.48,18.98],[18.98,19.49],[19.49,19.92],[19.92,20.18],[20.18,20.45],[20.45,20.92],[20.92,21.28],[21.28,21.88],[21.88,22.68],[22.88,23.48],[23.48,24.08],[24.08,24.46],[24.46,25.4],[25.4,25.78],[25.78,26.18],[26.18,26.85],[27.38,27.68],[27.68,28.12],[28.2,28.38]],"female":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.4],[1.67,1.8],[1.8,2.7],[2.7,3.4],[3.4,3.85],[3.85,4.21],[4.21,4.48],[4.48,4.84],[4.84,5.29],[5.29,5.56],[5.56,6.01],[6.01,6.37],[6.37,6.5],[6.5,7.69],[7.69,8.87],[8.87,10.06],[10.06,11.0],[11.0,12.19],[12.19,12.9],[12.9,13.2],[13.2,13.7],[13.7,14.1],[14.1,14.75],[14.97,15.4],[15.4,15.8],[15.8,16.3],[16.3,16.67],[16.67,17.34],[17.34,17.67],[17.67,18.5],[19.24,19.94],[19.94,20.74],[20.74,21.08],[21.43,21.94],[21.94,22.1],[22.1,22.54],[22.54,22.74],[22.74,23.24],[23.24,23.43],[23.43,25.14],[25.14,25.74],[25.74,26.14],[26.14,27.14],[27.14,27.54],[27.54,27.94],[27.94,28.8],[29.14,29.64],[29.64,30.02],[30.09,30.24]]},"sync":[[["வியன்புலம்","wide field"]],[["படர்ந்த","that traversed"]],[["பல்ஆ","many cows"]],[["நெடுஏறு","tall bull"]],[["மடலை","beautiful palmyra"]],[["மாண்நிழல்","excellent shade"]],[["அசைவிடக்","to rest"]],[["கோவலர்","cowherds"]],[["வீததை","dense with blossoms"]],[["முல்லைப்","jasmine"]],[["பூப்பறிக்குந்து","they pluck flowers"]],[["பூப்பறிக்குந்து","they pluck flowers"]],[["குறுங்கோல்","short stick"]],[["எறிந்த","thrown"]],[["நெடுஞ்செவிக்","